// ORB Retest Strategy — break of prior day high/low, then enter on the retest.
//
// Logic (4 stages, re-armed independently every time the state resets to idle):
//   1. TRACK LEVELS — the prior completed day's high (PDH) and low (PDL) are
//      tracked live from the current chart's own bars (no higher-timeframe
//      request.security lookahead needed), so they update once per new day
//      and never repaint.
//   2. CLEAN BREAKOUT — a bar's close must cross above PDH (or below PDL) by
//      at least `minBreakoutAtrMult` x ATR beyond the level, AND (optionally)
//      agree with session VWAP. That's what makes it a "clean" break instead
//      of a one-tick poke through the level during a move that's actually
//      reversing. Once this fires, the setup is "armed" and waits for a
//      retest — no new breakout is looked for until this one resolves
//      (enters, fails, or times out).
//   3. RETEST — while armed, if price closes back through the level entirely
//      (giving the breakout back), the setup is cancelled. If instead price
//      pulls back and tags the level (within `retestToleranceAtrMult` x ATR)
//      while still closing back beyond it, that's the retest holding as
//      new support/resistance -> entry signal. A setup that neither resolves
//      nor times out within `maxWaitBars` is cancelled.
//   4. ENTRY / STOP / EXIT — enters at the retest bar's close. Stop is placed
//      just beyond that bar's low (longs) or high (shorts), padded by
//      `stopBufferAtrMult` x ATR. Position size is derived from
//      `riskPercentPerTrade` of current equity divided by the per-unit risk,
//      so every trade risks the same % of equity regardless of how far the
//      stop sits from entry. The exit itself is scale-out + trail by default
//      (see v2 notes below), or a single fixed R-multiple target if you turn
//      that off.
//
// Only one position at a time (pyramiding=0). Works on any intraday
// timeframe. Breakouts/entries default to restricted to the first 90
// minutes after the open (09:30-11:00) since that's where ORB setups get
// the volume/liquidity to actually follow through - adjust the session
// input for a different market's open, or turn "Restrict breakouts/entries
// to session window" off to trade breakouts at any time of day. For 24/7
// markets (crypto), also leave "Compute prior day high/low from regular
// session only" off.
//
// v2 FIXES (from reviewing two backtested PLTR 1-min trades that both landed
// on the wrong side of the same violent intraday reversal):
//   1. FIXED R TARGET CAPPED A WINNER — the short in that pair closed at a
//      flat 2R limit right as the real continuation move was just getting
//      going, banking a small win and leaving the much larger subsequent
//      drop uncaptured. Root cause: a single `strategy.exit(stop=, limit=)`
//      closes the WHOLE position the instant the fixed target is touched,
//      with no way to keep riding a trend day. Fixed by replacing it with
//      scale-out + trail (below) so the strategy still books partial profit
//      early but lets a real trend run for the remainder.
//   2. THIN BREAKOUT FILTER — minBreakoutAtrMult defaulted to 0.1x ATR. On a
//      1-min chart with a small ATR, this is easily cleared by ordinary
//      noise, so the "clean breakout" gate wasn't filtering much. Default
//      raised to 0.3x ATR.
//   3. NO TREND CHECK — a PDH-retest long could arm even if the broader move
//      was actually rolling over (that's what happened to the long in that
//      pair, stopped out right before a hard breakdown). Added an optional
//      session-VWAP alignment filter: longs only arm above VWAP, shorts only
//      below it.
//   4. EXECUTION-PRICE MISMATCH — the strategy computed stop/target/qty off
//      the signal bar's `close`, but without `process_orders_on_close=true`
//      Pine fills market orders at the NEXT bar's open, not that close. On a
//      fast-moving 1-min name that's real, unaccounted-for slippage between
//      the assumed and actual fill price. Added `process_orders_on_close=true`
//      (matches how the other two strategies in this repo already work) so
//      the fill lines up with the bar the stop/target math was based on.
//
// SCALE-OUT + TRAIL EXIT (new default exit model): at entry, a limit order
// closes `partialPct`% of the position at `partialAtRMultiple` x the initial
// risk (banks profit early). Once that partial fills, the stop for the
// remaining runner moves to breakeven (optional) and then trails by
// `trailAtrMult` x ATR off the highest high (longs) / lowest low (shorts)
// since entry — ratcheting only in the trade's favor, same mechanism as
// pine/BMNR_TrendSwing_v1.pine's chandelier stop. A distant `hardCapRMultiple`
// limit order remains as a safety backstop in case of a gap the trailing
// stop can't react to intrabar. Turn `usePartialAndTrail` off to fall back
// to the original single fixed-R exit.
//
// Past performance in the Strategy Tester is hypothetical and not indicative
// of future results. Research/comparison tool only.

//@version=6
strategy("ORB Retest Strategy v2 (Break of Prior Day High/Low + Retest Entry, Scale-Out/Trail)",
     shorttitle="ORB Retest v2", overlay=true, initial_capital=10000, currency=currency.USD,
     commission_type=strategy.commission.percent, commission_value=0.05, slippage=1,
     pyramiding=0, calc_on_every_tick=false, process_orders_on_close=true)

// ───────────────────────────── Inputs ─────────────────────────────

grpLevels = "Prior Day Levels"
grpBreak  = "Breakout Filter"
grpTrend  = "Trend Filter"
grpRetest = "Retest Entry"
grpExit   = "Risk / Reward"
grpSess   = "Session"
grpDisp   = "Display"

atrLen = input.int(14, "ATR Length (used for all distance/buffer filters)", group=grpBreak)

useRthLevels = input.bool(false, "Compute prior day high/low from regular session only", group=grpLevels,
     tooltip="Leave off for 24/7 markets (crypto) or futures where the full day's range should count.")
rthSession   = input.session("0930-1600", "Regular session (if restricting above)", group=grpLevels)

allowLongs  = input.bool(true, "Allow longs (break above PDH + retest)", group=grpBreak)
allowShorts = input.bool(true, "Allow shorts (break below PDL + retest)", group=grpBreak)
minBreakoutAtrMult = input.float(0.3, "Min breakout distance beyond level (x ATR)", step=0.05, minval=0,
     group=grpBreak, tooltip="How far the breakout bar's close must clear the level to count as a clean break, not a marginal poke through it. Raised from an original 0.1x default, which barely cleared ordinary 1-min noise and let low-conviction breakouts arm.")

useVwapFilter = input.bool(true, "Only arm breakouts aligned with session VWAP", group=grpTrend,
     tooltip="Longs only arm when close is above session VWAP; shorts only when below. Filters out PDH/PDL crosses that are really counter-trend exhaustion moves rather than genuine continuation.")

retestToleranceAtrMult = input.float(0.15, "Retest tolerance (x ATR)", step=0.05, minval=0, group=grpRetest,
     tooltip="How close the pullback must come to the level to count as tagging it.")
maxWaitBars = input.int(40, "Max bars to wait for retest after breakout", minval=1, group=grpRetest)

riskPercentPerTrade = input.float(1.0, "Risk per trade (% of equity)", step=0.25, minval=0.05, group=grpExit)
stopBufferAtrMult   = input.float(0.15, "Stop buffer beyond retest high/low (x ATR)", step=0.05, minval=0, group=grpExit)

usePartialAndTrail = input.bool(true, "Scale out at first target, trail the rest", group=grpExit,
     tooltip="OFF falls back to a single fixed R-multiple target for the whole position (the original v1 behavior). ON books partial profit early and trails an ATR stop on the remainder so a real trend day isn't capped.")
partialAtRMultiple = input.float(1.0, "Take partial profit at this R multiple", step=0.25, minval=0.25, group=grpExit)
partialPct = input.float(50, "Percent of position closed at partial target", step=5, minval=5, maxval=95, group=grpExit)
moveStopToBreakevenOnPartial = input.bool(true, "Move runner's stop to breakeven once partial fills", group=grpExit)
trailAtrMult = input.float(2.5, "Trail runner by N x ATR off the extreme since entry", step=0.25, minval=0.5, group=grpExit)
hardCapRMultiple = input.float(5.0, "Hard-cap safety target for the runner (R multiple)", step=0.5, minval=1, group=grpExit,
     tooltip="Distant backstop limit in case of a gap the trailing stop can't react to intrabar. Not meant to be hit in the normal case — the trailing stop should exit first on a real trend.")
rewardMultiple = input.float(2.0, "Legacy fixed Reward:Risk multiple (R)", step=0.5, minval=0.5, group=grpExit,
     tooltip="Only used when 'Scale out at first target, trail the rest' is OFF.")

useSession   = input.bool(true, "Restrict breakouts/entries to session window", group=grpSess,
     tooltip="ORB edges come from the volume/liquidity right after the open - defaults to the first 90 minutes of US market hours (09:30-11:00). Turn off only if you specifically want to trade breakouts at any time of day.")
sessionInput = input.session("0930-1100", "Session (exchange time, e.g. first 90 min after open)", group=grpSess)

showLevels        = input.bool(true, "Plot prior day high/low", group=grpDisp)
showSetupMarkers  = input.bool(true, "Show breakout/retest markers", group=grpDisp)
showTradeLevels   = input.bool(true, "Show entry/stop/target lines for open trade", group=grpDisp)
showDashboard     = input.bool(true, "Show status table", group=grpDisp)

// ───────────────────────────── Core calcs ─────────────────────────────

atrVal  = ta.atr(atrLen)
vwapVal = ta.vwap(hlc3)

inSession = not useSession or not na(time(timeframe.period, sessionInput))
inRth     = not useRthLevels or not na(time(timeframe.period, rthSession))

passesTrendLong  = not useVwapFilter or close > vwapVal
passesTrendShort = not useVwapFilter or close < vwapVal

// state: 0 = idle (watching for a breakout), 1 = armed long (waiting for PDH retest),
// 2 = armed short (waiting for PDL retest)
var int   state         = 0
var int   barsInState   = 0
var float breakoutLevel = na

var float entryPriceVar     = na
var float stopVar           = na
var float targetVar         = na
var float partialTargetVar  = na
var float hardCapTargetVar  = na
var float entryQtyVar       = na

// Runner trail state, kept separate per direction so one side's flat-state
// reset (its own "else" branch) can never clobber the other side's live value
// on the same bar.
var float extremeSinceEntry  = na
var float lowestSinceEntry   = na
var float runnerStopLongVar  = na
var float runnerStopShortVar = na

// ───────────────────────────── Prior day high / low ─────────────────────────────

var float pdh     = na
var float pdl     = na
var float dayHigh = na
var float dayLow  = na

isNewDay = ta.change(time("D")) != 0

if isNewDay
    pdh := dayHigh
    pdl := dayLow
    dayHigh := high
    dayLow  := low
    // Yesterday's level is gone the moment a new day starts - any setup
    // still armed against it is stale and needs a fresh breakout of today's level.
    state := 0
    barsInState := 0
else
    if inRth
        dayHigh := na(dayHigh) ? high : math.max(dayHigh, high)
        dayLow  := na(dayLow)  ? low  : math.min(dayLow, low)

// ───────────────────────────── Stage 2: clean breakout (arm the setup) ─────────────────────────────

breakoutUpEvent   = false
breakoutDownEvent = false

if state == 0 and inSession
    if allowLongs and passesTrendLong and not na(pdh) and ta.crossover(close, pdh) and (close - pdh) >= minBreakoutAtrMult * atrVal
        state := 1
        breakoutLevel := pdh
        barsInState := 0
        breakoutUpEvent := true
    else if allowShorts and passesTrendShort and not na(pdl) and ta.crossunder(close, pdl) and (pdl - close) >= minBreakoutAtrMult * atrVal
        state := 2
        breakoutLevel := pdl
        barsInState := 0
        breakoutDownEvent := true

// ───────────────────────────── Stage 3: wait for the retest ─────────────────────────────

longRetestSignal  = false
shortRetestSignal = false

if state == 1
    barsInState += 1
    if close < breakoutLevel
        // Gave the whole breakout back before ever retesting - setup failed.
        state := 0
        barsInState := 0
    else if inSession and low <= breakoutLevel + retestToleranceAtrMult * atrVal
        longRetestSignal := true
    else if barsInState >= maxWaitBars
        state := 0
        barsInState := 0

if state == 2
    barsInState += 1
    if close > breakoutLevel
        state := 0
        barsInState := 0
    else if inSession and high >= breakoutLevel - retestToleranceAtrMult * atrVal
        shortRetestSignal := true
    else if barsInState >= maxWaitBars
        state := 0
        barsInState := 0

// ───────────────────────────── Stage 4: entry, stop, exit orders ─────────────────────────────

longEntryNow  = false
shortEntryNow = false

if longRetestSignal
    if strategy.position_size == 0 and inSession
        stopCandidate = low - stopBufferAtrMult * atrVal
        riskPerUnit = close - stopCandidate
        if riskPerUnit > 0
            qty = (strategy.equity * riskPercentPerTrade / 100) / riskPerUnit
            strategy.entry("Long", strategy.long, qty=qty)
            entryPriceVar := close
            stopVar := stopCandidate
            entryQtyVar := qty
            if usePartialAndTrail
                partialTargetVar := close + partialAtRMultiple * riskPerUnit
                hardCapTargetVar := close + hardCapRMultiple * riskPerUnit
                targetVar := hardCapTargetVar
                strategy.exit("Long Partial", from_entry="Long", qty_percent=partialPct, limit=partialTargetVar, stop=stopVar)
                strategy.exit("Long Runner",  from_entry="Long", qty_percent=100, stop=stopVar, limit=hardCapTargetVar)
            else
                targetVar := close + rewardMultiple * riskPerUnit
                strategy.exit("Long Exit", from_entry="Long", stop=stopVar, limit=targetVar)
            longEntryNow := true
    // One retest attempt per breakout, taken or not - back to idle either way.
    state := 0
    barsInState := 0

if shortRetestSignal
    if strategy.position_size == 0 and inSession
        stopCandidate = high + stopBufferAtrMult * atrVal
        riskPerUnit = stopCandidate - close
        if riskPerUnit > 0
            qty = (strategy.equity * riskPercentPerTrade / 100) / riskPerUnit
            strategy.entry("Short", strategy.short, qty=qty)
            entryPriceVar := close
            stopVar := stopCandidate
            entryQtyVar := qty
            if usePartialAndTrail
                partialTargetVar := close - partialAtRMultiple * riskPerUnit
                hardCapTargetVar := close - hardCapRMultiple * riskPerUnit
                targetVar := hardCapTargetVar
                strategy.exit("Short Partial", from_entry="Short", qty_percent=partialPct, limit=partialTargetVar, stop=stopVar)
                strategy.exit("Short Runner",  from_entry="Short", qty_percent=100, stop=stopVar, limit=hardCapTargetVar)
            else
                targetVar := close - rewardMultiple * riskPerUnit
                strategy.exit("Short Exit", from_entry="Short", stop=stopVar, limit=targetVar)
            shortEntryNow := true
    state := 0
    barsInState := 0

// ───────────────────────────── Runner trail management (after partial fills) ─────────────────────────────
// Re-issues the "Runner" exit order every bar with a ratcheting stop once the
// partial target has filled: breakeven first (optional), then an ATR
// chandelier trail off the extreme since entry — mirrors
// pine/BMNR_TrendSwing_v1.pine's trailing-stop mechanism. Inferred purely
// from position size shrinking below the original entry qty, since Pine
// strategies don't expose a direct "was this specific exit order filled" flag.

partialFilledLong  = usePartialAndTrail and strategy.position_size > 0 and not na(entryQtyVar) and strategy.position_size < entryQtyVar - syminfo.mintick
partialFilledShort = usePartialAndTrail and strategy.position_size < 0 and not na(entryQtyVar) and math.abs(strategy.position_size) < entryQtyVar - syminfo.mintick

if strategy.position_size > 0
    extremeSinceEntry := na(extremeSinceEntry) ? high : math.max(extremeSinceEntry, high)
    if partialFilledLong
        chandStop = extremeSinceEntry - trailAtrMult * atrVal
        floorStop = moveStopToBreakevenOnPartial ? math.max(chandStop, entryPriceVar) : chandStop
        runnerStopLongVar := na(runnerStopLongVar) ? math.max(floorStop, stopVar) : math.max(runnerStopLongVar, floorStop)
        strategy.exit("Long Runner", from_entry="Long", qty_percent=100, stop=runnerStopLongVar, limit=hardCapTargetVar)
    else
        runnerStopLongVar := stopVar
else
    extremeSinceEntry := na
    runnerStopLongVar := na

if strategy.position_size < 0
    lowestSinceEntry := na(lowestSinceEntry) ? low : math.min(lowestSinceEntry, low)
    if partialFilledShort
        chandStopS = lowestSinceEntry + trailAtrMult * atrVal
        floorStopS = moveStopToBreakevenOnPartial ? math.min(chandStopS, entryPriceVar) : chandStopS
        runnerStopShortVar := na(runnerStopShortVar) ? math.min(floorStopS, stopVar) : math.min(runnerStopShortVar, floorStopS)
        strategy.exit("Short Runner", from_entry="Short", qty_percent=100, stop=runnerStopShortVar, limit=hardCapTargetVar)
    else
        runnerStopShortVar := stopVar
else
    lowestSinceEntry := na
    runnerStopShortVar := na

// ───────────────────────────── Plots ─────────────────────────────

plot(showLevels ? pdh : na, "Prior Day High", color=color.new(color.blue, 0), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=1)
plot(showLevels ? pdl : na, "Prior Day Low",  color=color.new(color.orange, 0), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=1)
plot(showLevels ? vwapVal : na, "Session VWAP", color=color.new(color.purple, 40), style=plot.style_line, linewidth=1)

plotshape(showSetupMarkers and breakoutUpEvent, title="Breakout Up", style=shape.triangleup,
     location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.blue, 0), size=size.tiny, text="BO")
plotshape(showSetupMarkers and breakoutDownEvent, title="Breakout Down", style=shape.triangledown,
     location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.blue, 0), size=size.tiny, text="BO")

plotshape(showSetupMarkers and longEntryNow, title="Long Entry (Retest)", style=shape.triangleup,
     location=location.belowbar, color=color.new(color.lime, 0), size=size.small, text="LONG")
plotshape(showSetupMarkers and shortEntryNow, title="Short Entry (Retest)", style=shape.triangledown,
     location=location.abovebar, color=color.new(color.red, 0), size=size.small, text="SHORT")

bgcolor(state == 1 ? color.new(color.lime, 90) : state == 2 ? color.new(color.red, 90) : na,
     title="Armed Setup Highlight")

activeStopLong  = strategy.position_size > 0 ? (partialFilledLong ? runnerStopLongVar : stopVar) : na
activeStopShort = strategy.position_size < 0 ? (partialFilledShort ? runnerStopShortVar : stopVar) : na

tradeEntryPlot   = strategy.position_size != 0 ? entryPriceVar : na
tradeStopPlot    = strategy.position_size > 0 ? activeStopLong : strategy.position_size < 0 ? activeStopShort : na
tradeTargetPlot  = strategy.position_size != 0 ? targetVar : na
tradePartialPlot = usePartialAndTrail and strategy.position_size != 0 ? partialTargetVar : na

plot(showTradeLevels ? tradeEntryPlot : na, "Entry Price",
     color=color.new(color.gray, 20), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=1)
plot(showTradeLevels ? tradeStopPlot : na, "Stop Loss",
     color=color.new(color.red, 0), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=2)
plot(showTradeLevels ? tradePartialPlot : na, "Partial Target",
     color=color.new(color.teal, 30), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=1)
plot(showTradeLevels ? tradeTargetPlot : na, "Take Profit / Hard Cap",
     color=color.new(color.green, 0), style=plot.style_linebr, linewidth=2)

if showTradeLevels and longEntryNow
    label.new(bar_index, stopVar, "SL " + str.tostring(stopVar, format.mintick),
         style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.red, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
    label.new(bar_index, targetVar, "TP " + str.tostring(targetVar, format.mintick),
         style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.green, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
if showTradeLevels and shortEntryNow
    label.new(bar_index, stopVar, "SL " + str.tostring(stopVar, format.mintick),
         style=label.style_label_down, color=color.new(color.red, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)
    label.new(bar_index, targetVar, "TP " + str.tostring(targetVar, format.mintick),
         style=label.style_label_up, color=color.new(color.green, 15), textcolor=color.white, size=size.tiny)

// ───────────────────────────── Dashboard ─────────────────────────────

var table dash = table.new(position.top_right, 2, 8, border_width=1)

if showDashboard and barstate.islast
    stateLabel = state == 1 ? "Armed: waiting long retest" : state == 2 ? "Armed: waiting short retest" : "Idle: watching for breakout"
    stateColor = state == 1 ? color.new(color.green, 60) : state == 2 ? color.new(color.red, 60) : color.new(color.gray, 70)

    table.cell(dash, 0, 0, "Setup State", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 0, stateLabel, bgcolor=stateColor)

    table.cell(dash, 0, 1, "Prior Day High", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 1, na(pdh) ? "n/a" : str.tostring(pdh, format.mintick))

    table.cell(dash, 0, 2, "Prior Day Low", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 2, na(pdl) ? "n/a" : str.tostring(pdl, format.mintick))

    table.cell(dash, 0, 3, "ATR", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 3, str.tostring(atrVal, format.mintick))

    table.cell(dash, 0, 4, "Bars Waiting", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 4, state == 0 ? "-" : str.tostring(barsInState) + " / " + str.tostring(maxWaitBars))

    table.cell(dash, 0, 5, "In Session", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    table.cell(dash, 1, 5, inSession ? "Yes" : "No",
         bgcolor=inSession ? color.new(color.green, 60) : color.new(color.red, 60))

    table.cell(dash, 0, 6, "Partial Taken", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    partialLabel = strategy.position_size == 0 ? "-" : (partialFilledLong or partialFilledShort) ? "Yes" : "No"
    table.cell(dash, 1, 6, partialLabel)

    table.cell(dash, 0, 7, "Runner Stop", bgcolor=color.gray, text_color=color.white)
    runnerTxt = strategy.position_size > 0 ? str.tostring(activeStopLong, format.mintick) : strategy.position_size < 0 ? str.tostring(activeStopShort, format.mintick) : "-"
    table.cell(dash, 1, 7, runnerTxt)

// ───────────────────────────── Alerts ─────────────────────────────

alertcondition(longEntryNow, title="ORB Long Entry", message="{{ticker}} ORB retest long entry at {{close}}")
alertcondition(shortEntryNow, title="ORB Short Entry", message="{{ticker}} ORB retest short entry at {{close}}")

